WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You can hear a sound, feel completely sure,
and still be mistaken about what played.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1976, researchers paired a spoken sound
with mismatched lips.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some people reported a third syllable,
absent from the soundtrack.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But not everyone hears it, and answer options
can change what gets reported.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
This is evidence about perception—not proof
that a brain-audio product boosts focus.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the original study, try a free observation
exercise, then decide what paid audio is worth.
